Firstly, I would like to say that I noticed a price drop just a few days after purchasing it, and received a negative review. However, I still consider it quite good overall, with high value for money, sufficient CPU and GPU performance to handle mainstream online games and most of the larger single-player titles. The cooling system is excellent, but there's a minor issue with screen leakage (a common problem with IPS screens). The audio quality isn't great, and the hard drive seems subpar (I recommend adding an SSD yourself). After taking the computer to the service center yesterday for hardware inspection, everything was found to be in perfect condition. The built-in Windows 8.1 version wasn't very user-friendly, so upgrading to Windows 10 would be recommended. The seller shipped quickly, and all my inquiries were answered promptly. The invoice arrived two days after receiving the computer, which was satisfactory. Unfortunately, there weren't any gift items included.
(And just to mention, do not buy stickers for your keyboards from E-K Cool in Taobao; they ship slowly and have poor quality products. If you encounter any issues with them, they won't refund or replace them. The owner is also full of dirty talk.)
Scoundrel!
At the time of purchase, it was said on the activity page that you would receive "Three Body Complete Works" for every 99 yuan spent. Upon receiving the goods, there was no such gift. When calling customer service to ask about this issue, they asked if we could show them screenshots from the original activity page. Who bought the items and then saved the web page screenshot? Isn't it your own activity where customers should provide evidence themselves next time?各位买家，请务必注意保存好相关证据。
Warn everyone not to waste money.
Firstly, I was eagerly anticipating purchasing and thought that all of the products from the Aroma brand would not be too bad. After receiving them, I found the packaging to be decent enough, with an acceptable size. However, one box out of every few had mostly soft pieces, which were difficult to detect visually but could be felt when touched. When tasted, there was no discernible flavor; it was bland and tasteless. The fruit flesh around the core turned dark yellow after being bitten, indicating that they were defective in quality. Only about one-third of the items were actually consumable, so I strongly advise against buying them. They are also quite expensive for such poor quality!
A Lesson Learned: I'll Never Buy Fruits on E-commerce Again!
Image quality is really unacceptable.
As the title “The Atlas of Ancient Maps,” this book is really hard to accept in terms of its choice and arrangement of images, printing quality, etc., with some even having pixelation that makes them almost impossible to read.
Even if this book is not an atlas proper, even if it contains small-format illustrations, it should deserve to be worthy of the vast array of Middle Ages manuscripts listed in its preface!
And how is it different to use such images to assemble a book than not using them at all?
! I am sorry for such an academic spirit.
On matters of writing, no opinion is offered; each has his own discernment.
Overall 2 stars.
Good shopping
East and West both highly recommend!
I still believe in Amazon’s own products; now that we can buy overseas, it is convenient to get things shipped back from abroad and the shipping time is just a few days longer than domestic shipments. I have no doubt about Amazon’s ability to clear customs for us when buying overseas goods, which is much faster than going through a third-party carrier. Therefore, many people are turning to Amazon’s Overseas Shopping service to purchase items online.
I hope that domestic products will be of better quality and lower prices; many things are domestically produced but come back cheaper abroad than in China. I hope to see improvements.
To have bought something that has been opened before
It’s actually quite high to tax machines that cost over three hundred yuan at this rate; it feels better now that they’re around six hundred yuan.
The tape seal looks suspiciously like it has been opened; I took a photo right away and sure enough, it ripped open when I tried to pull it off. Inside was some damaged cardboard that made me think someone had returned it before the anniversary. I quickly gave it a try for my husband, but alas, there was no power at all in the machine. Thankfully, the blade didn't have any debris inside, or how would we return it so far?
It is not known whether it will work well or if there might be any problems in the short term. As with previous reviews, items that were shipped when out of stock turned out to be unreliable!
Overall satisfaction
Previously I was worried about the camera's packaging; this time it turned out to be better. There is an airbag inside, and the three codes of the camera match up, so you can register on the official website. The shutter count is zero, but everything else will have to wait for time to test.
Delivery speed is pretty good here. I have to vent about the courier guys who keep my expensive items in the lobby and leave so quickly that I can't even open them in front of him. This just makes me feel utterly useless.
Too small; no umbrella cover; average material.
It's not big!
Second Totes, 1. This one has no umbrella cover. 2. The handle material is average. 3. It clearly says Large, but it's actually meant for one person and won't be enough for two people.
And before in America I bought that one that can be used by three people without any pressure.
It's okay for East and West, but Amazon’s customer service is really worse than other websites.
After placing an order and realizing it was placed incorrectly, but there is no way to cancel the order, the online customer service always displays an error link that cannot be contacted.
After delivery, the delivery person called me and said I didn't want it anymore; I wanted to cancel the order but it wasn't successful. The delivery person took it back and said they would sign for it first so that I could apply for a return.
When requesting a return, it is only then that you learn that food items cannot be returned once delivered, and there's no way to contact Amazon customer service either.
I have returned items that were not returnable under policy at JD and Suning before, including milk and diapers. I contacted customer service for returns in all cases, and they refunded me. However, when it comes to Amazon, things are different.
How did you handle it with your customer service?
Tell me either I take it myself or let the delivery person buy it himself; how can I expect him to pay for something that is not his own purchase?
Okay, I won't back out either; I'll take it myself and give you one star for your service.
Earphone hum and noise
This pair of headphones is rubbish; I don't know if it's my ears that have gone bad or if these headphones really aren't as good as they used to be.
I bought a blue one from some easy two years ago; it had good sound quality with no hiss and decent bass. I've been using it for over two years now, but it's starting to wear out. I'm planning on buying another one (URBEATS), as I find it quite satisfactory.
And then I saw it was purple and rather nice looking, but when I opened it up today to listen to it, I realized that one side had a loud voice while the other had a quiet voice.
I thought it was just the sound effects of that song and didn't give much thought to it at first, but after listening for hours I realized this problem was quite serious. Not only were there off-key notes, but also poor bass quality compared to what I had heard before. There were some additional noises, is it possible that only my purple headphones have this issue? Or could it be that the headphone manufacturing process has indeed fallen short?
Terrible feedback; very disappointed.
Make sure to return it tomorrow during the day.
PS looks good.
Amazon's own should not be selling such products.
Buy during sales; not cheap; good reviews.
When I received the product, it left me speechless; there was extensive wear and tear on the surface, as well as damage in other areas – not a defective item but an old one, or at least second-hand. Please see the attached image for details.
I am applying for a return; the manufacturer's people say it was caused by transportation, is this not nonsense?
How can something be worn out within a product?
There are only two possibilities: either defective or old goods; or I deliberately damaged the product and returned it.
In objective terms, I do not have evidence to prove that I did not damage the product, but based on my credit record for shopping on Amazon, I believe such products should not be included in Amazon's own goods; customer choice is trust, and we all win. Customer victory is also the victory of the manufacturer. Let us work together to improve this situation, thank you.
Very satisfied with the watch.
It is definitely genuine; I have checked it at the boutique and the watch looks very nice in appearance with fine workmanship. The materials used are sufficient, and as it has an imported mechanical movement, it carries some weight. It cannot be compared to those so-called mechanical watches priced around 300 yuan. This is authentic merchandise.
The watch is accurate and within acceptable error limits; it comes with a jewelry appraisal certificate inside the box, and the 12-word mark on the dial is genuine diamond. It fits well for personal use, and as a gift, it adds to one's prestige.
Bentley is indeed good.
It's good on both sides.
It was quite good on both sides, but I had some unpleasantness with the courier when I wasn't in Canada to send it during lunchtime. The company simply put the mail in the locker without sending me an SMS for verification of pickup, which caused me to run twice.
But the item is indeed good.
Authentic! Packaging is perfect.
The packaging is complete; an inflatable bag was added inside, and there's nothing but a product with no online reviews.
There was also an outer plastic film on the bottle that matched what is described in the picture, and it arrived quickly after I took a photo.
It's genuine; just out of stock at the moment and not sure when it will be back in stock.
It looks very good.
I had long been eyeing this camera, but for reasons other than price, I didn't buy it before. This time, because of the package discount, the price was still acceptable, so I bought it.
After buying it, everything else was fine except for connecting to software, which wouldn't work; I had to connect through 360WiFi and call Xiaomi customer service, but they couldn't solve the problem either, so I had to contact Amazon for after-sales support.
Another point to note is that I have seen user comments online stating that this camera supports the smallest storage card of 8GB; any smaller and it will not be recognized, so please pay attention to this issue.
It feels good to use it, but the picture quality is still acceptable, but the audio quality is very poor. The machine has some degree of heat generation, and if you keep it on for a long time, it feels like this level of heat is somewhat difficult to accept.
In summary, this product has many shortcomings and I hope that you will buy it with caution.
Light and large-capacity
I like it for its lightness and capacity but I find two separate compartments to be a bit excessive; I'm not sure what to put in them.
After buying it, I found that there was another brand similar one on Overseas Shopping (Meizu) for less than two hundred yuan.
Amazon shipping issues
Received goods were checked and found to be:
1. The packaging is severely worn out.
2. The table of contents is seriously misformatted.
3. The clock does not move; the lamp cannot be charged and used, nor can it adjust time.
4. Contact Amazon customer service separately and can only pay for shipping to the US and then make up the fee.
5. The reason for getting two stars is that customer service was good.
The first time I bought something, it had problems; all the lights were flashing and not working.
To request a refund, it took three days to get the goods to Shanghai and they still haven't been delivered.
Don't answer when called for delivery.
The courier company says they have that contact information only.
Amazon cannot find a place to lodge a complaint.
No request was ever made for delivery delays; I received an email saying that my requests were being ignored.
And what about transit issues?
After all, the poor shopping experience has me questioning the effectiveness of Amazon's logistics and control systems.
